    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rghy](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rghy) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 75.37 depth occurred on Oct 11 2025 129km E of Petropavlovsk-Kamchatsky. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 53.2522 longitude 159.7815. It impacted 130 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
